      "code": "C07J41/0038",
      "level": 9,
      "parent": "C07J41/0033",
      "ja": "｛アンドロスタン骨格を有するもので，　１８－位または１９－位が置換された誘導体，１８－位ノル誘導体および　，さらに１７－β位が他の炭素原子に直接結合しておらずかつアミド基の一部でもない炭素原子に置換された誘導体を含む｝　",
      "en": "{with an androstane skeleton, including 18- or 19-substituted derivatives, 18-nor derivatives and also derivatives where position 17-beta is substituted by a carbon atom not directly bonded to a further carbon atom and not being part of an amide group}",
      "count": 204,
      "ipcCode": "C07J41/00",
      "coreCode": "C07J41/00",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_C07J.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
